<https://ogcincubator.github.io/ospd-activity-types/> a skos:ConceptScheme,
        dcat:Catalog,
        bblocks:BBlocksRegister ;
    rdfs:label "Building Blocks - OSPD Activity Types" ;
    dct:abstract """Activity types used across the OGC Open Science Persistent Demonstrator (OSPD), consolidated under
stable `https://w3id.org/ogc/ospd/activity-type/` URIs and grouped into families of related types.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:description """A root *OSPD Activity type* block, a profile of the Registered Item Model's activity-type block, and one
sub-block (profile of the root) per family of related activity types. Each family block carries the Turtle
definitions of its activity types as a data resource, which is uploaded to the OSPD Prez instance when
the register is built.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:modified "2026-11-24T11:34:35.211402"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    void:sparqlEndpoint <https://defs-hosted.opengis.net/fuseki-ospd/query> ;
